  "text": "Board Certified Veterinary Surgeon - Bellevue Veterinary Emergency and Specialty\nSkip to content\nPay Bill Now\n(425) 629-0140\nAbout\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nOur Doctors\nOur Leadership\nNews\nCE Events\nMonthly Rounds\nGiving Back\nBlog\nOur Location\nTestimonials\nOur Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nSurgery\nClinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nPet Owners\nVisiting The Clinic?\nPayment Options\nGrief Support\nReferral Vets\nCareers\nContact Us\nAbout\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nOur Doctors\nOur Leadership\nNews\nCE Events\nMonthly Rounds\nGiving Back\nBlog\nOur Location\nTestimonials\nOur Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nSurgery\nClinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nPet Owners\nVisiting The Clinic?\nPayment Options\nGrief Support\nReferral Vets\nCareers\nContact Us\nReview Us\nPay Bill Now\n(425) 629-0140\nAbout\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nOur Doctors\nOur Leadership\nNews\nCE Events\nMonthly Rounds\nGiving Back\nBlog\nOur Location\nTestimonials\nOur Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nSurgery\nClinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nPet Owners\nVisiting The Clinic?\nPayment Options\nGrief Support\nReferral Vets\nCareers\nContact Us\nAbout\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nOur Doctors\nOur Leadership\nNews\nCE Events\nMonthly Rounds\nGiving Back\nBlog\nOur Location\nTestimonials\nOur Services\nEmergency & Critical Care\nSurgery\nClinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nPet Owners\nVisiting The Clinic?\nPayment Options\nGrief Support\nReferral Vets\nCareers\nContact Us\nSurgery\nBellevue Veterinary Emergency + Specialty has a Board Certified Surgeon on staff to offer advanced surgical techniques including both soft tissue and orthopedic to pets in need.\nWhat does a Board Certified Veterinary Surgeon do?\nBoard-certified veterinary surgeons are highly specialized professionals who perform advanced surgical procedures on animals to address complex injuries, diseases, and medical conditions. With their extensive training and expertise in surgical techniques, they provide specialized care and perform intricate surgeries beyond routine procedures.\nWhat to Expect\nDuring an appointment for an advanced surgery procedure, you can expect a thorough evaluation of your pet’s condition and an in-depth discussion of the surgical options available. These surgeons work closely with other\nveterinary specialists\n, utilizing advanced equipment and technologies to ensure optimal outcomes. The surgeon will review any diagnostic tests or imaging results and explain the recommended surgical procedure, including its potential risks and benefits.\nThey will address any questions or concerns you may have and provide you with a clear understanding of the treatment plan. Throughout the process, the surgeon will prioritize the well-being and comfort of your pet, providing comprehensive pre-operative and post-operative care to ensure a successful and smooth recovery. Their commitment to delivering advanced surgical interventions contributes significantly to improving the health and well-being of the animals under their care.\nAnastacia Davis\nDVM, MS Diplomate\nSurgeon\nAnastacia Davis, DVM, MS, DACVS-SA is a board-certified Veterinary Surgeon with substantial experience in performing a variety of soft tissue, orthopedic, and neurological procedures. Her primary interests are in oncologic, wound and reconstruction, cardiothoracic, cranial cruciate ligament, and intervertebral disc procedures.\nOur Doctors\nMeet The Team\nHaving an emergency?\nCall (425) 629-0140\nOpen 24/7\n(425) 629-0140\n2515 140th Ave. NE\nBellevue, WA 98005\nOpen 24/7\n(425) 629-0140\n2515 140th Ave. NE\nBellevue, WA 98005\nOpen 24/7\n2515 140th Ave. NE\nBellevue, WA 98005\n(425) 629-0140\ninfo@BellevueERSP.com\nOpen 24/7\nFacebook\nGoogle\nInstagram\nLinkedin\nContact Us\n\"\n*\n\" indicates required fields\nLinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName\n*\nEmail\n*\nEnter Email\nConfirm Email\nPhone\n*\nMessage\nHow Did You Hear About Us?\n*\nHow Did You Hear About Us?\nReferral from Friend\nReferral from Veterinary Hospital\nExisting Client\nSignage\nNeighbor\nGoogle Search\nBing Search\nGoogle Ad\nGoogle Maps\nFacebook\nFacebook Ad\nYelp\nApple Maps\nBusiness Listing Directory\nLocal Event\nPrint Advertisement\nPromotion\nOther\nPlease specify\n*\nPromotion Code\n*\nSubmit\nServices\nEmergency & Veterinary Critical Care\nSurgery\nVeterinary Clinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nVeterinary Internal Medicine\nCardiology\nEmergency & Veterinary Critical Care\nSurgery\nVeterinary Clinical Pathology & Diagnostics\nOncology\nVeterinary Internal Medicine\nCardiology\nClient Resources\nPet Owners\nPayment Options\nPet Grief Support\nPet Owners\nPayment Options\nPet Grief Support\nSupport\nContact Us\nCareers\nPrivacy Policy\nContact Us\nCareers\nPrivacy Policy\nScratch Pay plans in the U.S. are issued by WebBank. Scratch Pay plans in the U.S. are subject to eligibility and may not be available in all states.\nIn Canada, loans are issued by Scratch Financial, Inc.\nScratch Financial, Inc. DBA Scratchpay (NMLS ID 1582666).\n© 2026 Scratch Financial, Inc. All Rights Reserved.\nScratch, Scratch Pay, Scratchpay, Scratch Checkout, and the Heart Logo are trademarks of Scratch Financial, Inc.\n© 2026  Part of Lakefield Veterinary Group |\nPrivacy Policy\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions.\nFunctional\nFunctional\nAlways active\nThe technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences\nPreferences\nThe technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that are not requested by the subscriber or user.\nStatistics\nStatistics\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes.\nThe technical storage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. Without a subpoena, voluntary compliance on the part of your Internet Service Provider, or additional records from a third party, information stored or retrieved for this purpose alone cannot usually be used to identify you.\nMarketing\nMarketing\nThe technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes.\nManage options\nManage services\nManage {vendor_count} vendors\nRead more about these purposes\nAccept\nDeny\nView preferences\nSave preferences\nView preferences\n{title}\n{title}\n{title}\nManage consent\n×\nYou’re Leaving Our Website\nYou are now leaving this website and entering a third-party site. Please note that external sites may have different privacy policies, security practices, and terms of use.\nGo Back\nContinue",
